circuit "ROM with asynchronous read"

# Chu, Listing 11.5: a ROM written as a constant array in VHDL, the
# hex-to-7-segment table again (Listing 3.12): address in, word out, no
# clock. With no register around it, the tools build it from logic cells,
# so it is only for small tables. Open Memory to see the 16 words.

input  addr[4]
output data[7]

data = rom(addr, bits = 7, data = "01 4F 12 06 4C 24 20 0F 00 04 08 60 31 42 30 38")
